# 📘 Day 5 Notes – Web Fundamentals

## 🎯 Objective

Learn how websites work and understand the core concepts behind web communication.

Topics Covered:

* Client & Server
* URL Structure
* HTTP & HTTPS
* HTTP Methods
* HTTP Requests & Responses
* Status Codes
* Headers
